✴️ Day 6 of #90DaysOfDevOps

✔️ Today i learn about file manipulation in linux that every devops engineer must have.



✔️ Here what i practiced today :



🗒️ touch notes.txt : 

▶️ Created a new empty file


✍ echo ' ' > notes.txt : 

▶️ write content into the file or overwrite existing content

✍ echo ' ' >> notes.txt : 

▶️ append content without overwrite

👓 cat notes.txt : 

▶️ display the file content

👀 head -n 2 : 

▶️ display the first 2 lines of the file

👀 tail -n 2 : 

▶️ display the last 2 lines of the file

✍ echo ' ' | tee -a notes.txt : 

▶️ it's use for append text & display it on terminal simultaneousaly.
